    "title": "Privacy",
    "intro": "Your privacy matters. OneSpend stores your data locally, and it is only synced with our servers when you choose to.",
    "dataTitle": "Data we collect",
    "dataBody": "When you enable sync, the data you record (accounts, budgets, vendors, etc.) is encrypted and synced with our servers so you can access it from other devices.",
